{"title": "Dwarven Toughness", "pageid": 3960, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Dwarven_Toughness", "categories": ["Racial features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Dwarven Toughness</b> is a passive feature that increases a creature's <a href=\"/wiki/Hit_Points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Hit Points\">Hit Point</a> maximum by 1, and again by 1 every time they gain a level. It is a Subrace Trait for all <a href=\"/wiki/Gold_Dwarf\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Gold Dwarf\">Gold Dwarf</a> characters.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>You have 1 extra maximum <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hit_Point\" title=\"Hit Point\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/25px-HP_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/38px-HP_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/2/25/HP_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Hit Point\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/25px-HP_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/25/HP_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hit_Point\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Hit Point\">Hit Point</a> per level. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Races:\n\n</p>\n<ul><li>Character level 1: <a href=\"/wiki/Gold_Dwarf\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Gold Dwarf\">Gold Dwarf</a></li></ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:85%;\">(<a href=\"/wiki/Character_level\" title=\"Character level\">Character level</a> is the sum of all class levels for a multi-classed character.)</span>\n</p>\n</div>     \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714200108\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.026 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.030 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 637/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 3542/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1376/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 16/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.004/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 694813/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   25.883      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   25.883      1 -total\n 33.20%    8.594      1 Template:IconLink\n 31.21%    8.078      1 Template:Icon_text\n 27.35%    7.079      2 Template:Trim\n 23.86%    6.175      1 Template:Ifempty\n 16.00%    4.142      1 Template:PageSeo\n 14.89%    3.854      1 Template:Hidden_code\n 12.88%    3.335      1 Template:Main_namespace_only\n 12.78%    3.307      1 Template:Passive_weapons_list\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:3960-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714200108 and revision id 156868. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}